@startuml
!include _style.puml
left to right direction
title F08 求职者角色用例图
actor "求职者" as Seeker
actor "DeepSeek 服务" as LLM
actor "外部招聘网站" as Website
rectangle "SmartHire 系统边界" {
  usecase "UC01 注册与登录" as Login
  usecase "UC02 管理自己的简历\n上传照片 / 预览 / AI 解析" as Resume
  usecase "UC09 搜索在招岗位\n查看原始说明与来源" as Browse
  usecase "UC10 分析个人岗位匹配度" as Match
  usecase "校验个人简历与岗位状态" as Check
  usecase "生成求职准备建议" as Advice
  usecase "UC11 收藏岗位与记录进度\n保存个人备注" as Save
  usecase "UC12 查看历史匹配报告" as History
  usecase "UC13 打开原招聘网页" as Link
}
Seeker --> Login
Seeker --> Resume
Seeker --> Browse
Seeker --> Match
Seeker --> Save
Seeker --> History
Seeker --> Link
Match .> Check : <<include>>
Match .> Advice : <<include>>
LLM --> Advice
Website --> Link
note bottom of Link
实际投递发生在外部网站。
软件只打开来源链接，不向招聘方发送简历。
进度由求职者手动维护，不代表招聘方反馈。
end note
footer UML 用例图 | HR 与求职者的资料按账号隔离
@enduml
